    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shiseeng'wa shipanga n'ikūjo lya ng'wa SEEBA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu lūshikū lwa katanò ng'weji gwa kanè, ng'waka gwa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ng'waka gwa:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, ng'waka gwane gwa.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " makūmi adatū, naalī kū Mongo gwa Kebali hamò na basaamiwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Basaamiwa:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Banhū abo baasaamiwa kwīnga mu sī yabo kūja kū sī ītī yabo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ī ligūlū lyūkundūka nūbona koolekegeje ka ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūshikū lwa katanò ū mu ng'weji gwenūyo, gwalī ng'waka gwa katanò kwīngīīla ikanza lya kūsaamiwa kwa ntemi Yehoyakini; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūkang'wizīīla ngabīji Ezekia ng'witūnja o ng'wa Buzi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Buzi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, Ezekia ng'witūnja wa ngabīji Buzi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " walī kū Mongo gwa Kebali mu sī ya Bakalidayo. Ū nkono go ng'wa SEEBA gwalī hamò nang'hwe ū kwenūko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho nalola, nūbona nyaga gwa shūlūlū gūliza kūfumīīla mu sukuma, n'ilunde itaale līpīndiwe būpe būng'weku no no no, na moto gūkūligimaga bo kūlabya wangū wangū. A ha gatī ya moto shaliho kinhū gītī chūma shiteemagīzu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu moto shalīmo gītī shiseeng'wa shipanga shinè; ī suso yasho yaali giti munhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike būlī shene shalī na būshū būnè na manana anè. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A magūlū gasho gaalī magololoku, ī mhambala jasho jalī gītī chūūga sha ndama, na jateemagīlaga gītī chūma shape shiguusilwe shūng'weka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu mangwa ya manana ayo galī kū mhandī jose inè būlī hene gwalīho nkono gwa munhū. Ī shiseeng'wa shose būnè washo shalī na būshū na manana; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a manana gasho gaalī gikuumije. Būlī shene ūlū shilīselema shajaga kū būtongi dūhū, shalī shitagalūkaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu mihayo ya shikolile sha suso ya shiseeng'wa shenīsho kwalī gīkī, būlī shene shalī na suso ya būshū bo munhū, ū kū nkono gwa būlyo būlī shene shalī na suso ya būshū bo shimba, ū kū nkono gwa lūmoso būshū bo nzagamba, hama būlī shene shalī būshū bo ng'hoonà. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmò walī ū būshū washo. A manana gasho gaalī gaalile hūna gūgololoka kūj'igūlya, būlī shene manana abīlī; inana līmò liikuumije n'inana lichalyo ū kū shiseeng'wa īsho shalī bbihī nasho; manana abīlī gūūgūkumba ū mīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī shene ūlū shilīselema shajaga kū būtongi dūhū; ūko gūja ū moyo shajaga kwenūko; shalī shitagalūkaga ūlū shilīselema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shiseeng'wa shenīsho shaali sgītī makala ga moto gakangaalile, nūūlū gītī chenge shikūligimaga; moto ng'weku gwilibanhyaga ūko na ūko ū mu shiseeng'wa shenīsho, na ndabi jafumaga mo jikūlabyaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shiseeng'wa shipanga shenīsho shaselemaga ūko na ūko wangū no gītī lūlabi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho naashilola chiza ī shiseeng'wa shipanga, nūbona būlī shene shilī n'idandali a hasī lihelile nasho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nasho:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shihebulania shihayile nū būshū washo ū būnè.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A madandali genayo ūmò gabonekanīlaga nū mumo gaalī gabeegegije gaalī gīkī, gang'wekaga gītī kilisolito, a gose būnè wago gaalī gikolile. Būlī lyene lyali gītī lībeejiwe mu mbika y'idandali mu gatī y'idandali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū galīselema gajaga būlī kwene ū mu mhandī inè, ūko shalī shilolelile ī shiseeng'wa; a madandali gaalī gatagalūkaga ūlū shilīja ī shiseeng'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lingi ja madandali genayo jalī ngūngūhu no, hangī ja magaka; nīyo pyī ī lingi būnè wajo jalī jokalile miso py'a hose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shiseengw'a shipanga ūlū shaselema, na a madandali ayo gihelile nasho gaaselemaga hamò nasho; nūūlū shabūūka higūlya ya sī ī shiseeng'wa shipanga, na a madandali gabūūkaga a hasī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hose hose ūko gūūīlīla ū moyo, nasho shajaga, na a madandali gaabūūkaga hamò nasho; nguno ū moyo gwa shiseeng'wa shipanga gwal'ū mu madandali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shiseeng'wa ūlū shaselema, na a goi gaselemaga, ī shiseeng'wa ūlū shīmīīla shalembeela, na a goi gīmīīlaga gaalembeela, nūūlū shabūūka higūlya ya sī ī shiseeng'wa, na a madandali gabūūkaga a hasī; nguno ū moyo gwa shiseeng'wa shipanga gwal'ū mu madandali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A higūlya ya mitwe ya shiseeng'wa shipanga lyalīho lya kūbiza gīt'igūlū lyambile; iteemagīzu gītī ilole, hangī lya kogohya no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
